      "notes": "All 66 states and captions reviewed. The source is a large underpromotion composition with White Ka1/Bg1/Ne6/a2/a3/b6/c4/e6/e7/f2 versus Black Kc3/Bb8/c2. It illustrates a knight promotion, bishop promotion and rook promotion, using a b3 knight to blockade c2 and avoid queen-stalemate traps. The final rook/minor/pawn diagram still has ten pieces.",
